Storybook sidebar search: find components by alias.
Usage: add `alias:<Name>` to a component's `meta.tags`, e.g. `tags: ['alias:Modal']`.
Storybook has no option to configure the searched fields, so its built (minified) file is patched.
Re-check this patch on every Storybook upgrade (`pnpm patch storybook`).

